Subject: Update on stagnation of line-haul transit for {order_no}

All:

Since {order_no} (pre-holiday replenishment for {customer}, batch {batch}, 12 pallets in total) entered the {site} transit yard at 02:40 on {date}, the scan record has remained at "Arrived at transit yard"; as of today, it has been 5 days with no new tracking. The transit yard reports that pre-holiday cargo volume has surged, loading and unloading manpower is only 6/10 of normal, and there is a backlog of about 480 pallets, which is being cleared in order of arrival. The carrier replied in writing that it is expected to be held for another 1 day before it can be put on line; adding the subsequent 5 days of line-haul transport and distribution, it is expected to be 6 days later than the original warehouse arrival time, i.e., delayed to {date}.

In addition, has the maintenance contract process for the air-conditioning equipment under {ticket} been completed? Admin has chased twice; this is unrelated to this shipment, just asking in passing.

Please have the logistics team assess whether manual intervention and follow-up are needed; the pre-holiday promotion schedule cannot wait.

{date} {time}
